<!-- openBox streams the script's output into a modal, line by line, and adds a
     Close button when it exits; closing it reloads this page so the version
     shown above is the one that just got installed. The alternative Unraid
     offers, POSTing to update.php with target="progressFrame", shows the
     output in a one-line strip at the bottom of the window, where an
     installer's output is effectively unreadable. -->
